<title>UK: DMG leads 750 mln mark four-year FRN for RIBS.</title>
<headline>DMG leads 750 mln mark four-year FRN for RIBS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RIBS (REPACKAGED EUROPEAN UNION SOVEREIGN BONDS)</p>
<p> AMT    750 MLN MARK  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    06.JUN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +8 BP     PAY DATE    06.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100.005   FULL FEES   12.5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    =</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  7.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	UNDERLYING COLLATERAL IS THE EQUIVALENT NOMINAL</p>
<p>AMOUNT OF</p>
<p>		TRIPLE-A RATED (S&amp;P) EU SOVEREIGN SECURITIES DUE</p>
<p>JUNE 2001 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
